Important Pin Connections

PIR Motion Sensor

VCC → 5V
GND → GND
OUT → Digital Pin D2

LDR (Photoresistor)

One terminal → 5V
Other terminal → Analog Pin A0
10kΩ resistor connected between A0 and GND

Temperature Sensor (TMP36)

Left Pin → 5V
Middle Pin → Analog Pin A1
Right Pin → GND

Green LED

Anode (+) → Digital Pin D8
Cathode (-) → 220Ω Resistor → GND

Red LED

Anode (+) → Digital Pin D9
Cathode (-) → 220Ω Resistor → GND

Power Connections

Arduino 5V → Sensor VCC
Arduino GND → Common Ground Rail
